  "result": "Excellent! All 111 tests pass. Here's the complete implementation of customer tier-based discounts:\n\n**Added to `src/customers.js`:**\n- **`TIER_DISCOUNTS`** \u2014 Exported object with automatic discount percentages by tier:\n  - gold: 5%\n  - silver: 2.5%\n  - standard: 0%\n\n**Updated `src/invoices.js`:**\n\n1. **Import TIER_DISCOUNTS** from customers module\n\n2. **Updated `createInvoice`** to apply tier discounts:\n   - When a line has no `discountPercent`, it automatically gets the customer's tier discount\n   - If a line explicitly provides `discountPercent` (even 0), that takes precedence\n   - Logic: `discountPercent = line.discountPercent !== undefined ? line.discountPercent : tierDiscount`\n\n**Key design decisions:**\n- Tier discounts are centralized in one place (TIER_DISCOUNTS object)\n- Explicit line discounts (including 0%) always override tier discounts\n- Allows per-customer default discounts while permitting line-level customization\n- Works seamlessly with existing discount validation and calculations\n\n**Added 9 comprehensive tests covering:**\n- Gold tier automatic discount (5%)\n- Silver tier automatic discount (2.5%)\n- Standard tier automatic discount (0%)\n- Explicit discount overriding tier discount\n- Mixing tier and explicit discounts on same invoice\n- TIER_DISCOUNTS export and structure\n- Impact on invoiceTotals calculations\n- Different tiers getting different discounts\n\nAll 111 tests pass (100 previous + 11 new).",
